# Model card

Covers the two model families in GROUNDED NO MORE: the **demand forecasting models** and the **inventory policy models** (rotable float, reorder points, network positioning and the Readiness Frontier optimiser). Method details are in [METHODOLOGY.md](METHODOLOGY.md); known gaps are in [LIMITATIONS.md](LIMITATIONS.md).

Result values are computed from `outputs/` and `docs/data/` by `scripts/render_docs.py` (template: `docs/templates/MODEL_CARD.md.tmpl`). Headline results are from the v2 holdout (seeds {{RESULT:seeds.holdout}}, central world); selection-seed results ({{RESULT:seeds.selection}}) are labelled. A v1 world was archived after a domain review; see [archive/v1](archive/v1/README.md).

